majo static Experiment source
================================

The HTML, Astro, CSS, and browser controller in this directory are original
Firefly work and are provided under the repository license. The files under
public/media/ are owner-supplied local inputs and are not covered by this
notice. Astro emits them below dist/media/ for the assembled
/lab/majo/media/ mount. Their redistribution rights must be reviewed by the
owner before a public release.
